          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes UraGuard® different from other adult incontinence products?",
            "content": "<p>UraGuard® is designed with women’s health in mind. Unlike standard incontinence products, UraGuard® features patent-pending technology—a discreet shield that helps reduce exposure to bacteria trapped within the product. By acting as a barrier between bacteria and the urethral area, UraGuard® adds an extra layer of protection where it matters most.</p>",
