          "settings": {
            "heading": "Who is UraGuard® designed for?",
            "content": "<p>UraGuard® is designed for adult women who experience incontinence and are looking for a product that prioritizes comfort, dryness, and urinary health.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "1587700a-5ee8-43f8-a35f-d929db42fb22": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is UraGuard® gentle on sensitive skin?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! UraGuard® products are made with soft, skin-friendly materials chosen with sensitive skin in mind. If you experience any irritation, discontinue use and speak with your healthcare provider.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "bb27c4f2-0c26-45bf-8b45-d680bea4e03c": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does UraGuard® work?",
            "content": "<p>UraGuard® is a specialized barrier designed to help shield the wearer from bacteria held in the incontinence product. By helping reduce bacterial exposure, UraGuard® supports better daily hygiene and comfort.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "2c2aaa13-82fb-4138-aa8a-37f18b412379": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How often should I change my incontinence product?",
            "content": "<p>For optimal comfort and hygiene, we recommend changing your incontinence product as soon as it becomes wet, or at least every 4-6 hours, depending on individual needs.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "24d707a1-7b6d-40e9-a2b3-45c72368e607": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does UraGuard® work for men?",
            "content": "<p>UraGuard® is specifically designed for women, as it is shaped to fit the female anatomy. Men can continue to use their usual incontinence products, though the UraGuard® shield may not provide the same benefits. We are actively developing a version tailored for men—stay tuned!</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "77e8081d-3216-4f92-9f1e-bab5a6656d97": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is UraGuard® available as a pull-up or tabbed diaper?",
            "content": "<p>Currently, UraGuard® is available as a shield insert, allowing you to add our barrier protection to any existing incontinence product. However, we understand the need for an all-in-one solution, and we are actively exploring pull-up and tabbed-style options. Stay tuned for updates!</p>",
